{
 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "顺序规模时间",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 98.22,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "回头看这些事故，攻击者大多没有找到代码 bug。",
   "spoken": "回头看这些事故，攻击者大多没有找到代码 bug。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 5.738
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "他们改变的，是三样东西：顺序，规模，时间。",
   "spoken": "他们改变的，是三样东西：顺序，规模，时间。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-01.wav",
   "start": 6.14,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 6.14,
   "speechEnd": 10.408
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "防御也按这三样来设计。",
   "spoken": "防御也按这三样来设计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-02.wav",
   "start": 10.84,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 10.84,
   "speechEnd": 12.629
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "先说顺序。任何会减少抵押品，或者增加债务的路径，都必须在结束时检查健康因子。",
   "spoken": "先说顺序。任何会减少抵押品，或者增加债务的路径，都必须在结束时检查健康因子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-03.wav",
   "start": 13.06,
   "dur": 7.68,
   "speechStart": 13.06,
   "speechEnd": 20.531
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "新增一个函数，就要确认它走了这道检查。Euler 缺的，就是这一步。",
   "spoken": "新增一个函数，就要确认它走了这道检查。Euler 缺的，就是这一步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-04.wav",
   "start": 20.96,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 20.96,
   "speechEnd": 26.028
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "再说规模。低流动性抵押品要有供应上限，自家代币做抵押，要有额外限制。",
   "spoken": "再说规模。低流动性抵押品要有供应上限，自家代币做抵押，要有额外限制。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-05.wav",
   "start": 26.46,
   "dur": 6.8,
   "speechStart": 26.46,
   "speechEnd": 33.036
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "清算奖励在极端行情下也要有吸引力，清算折扣要有上限。",
   "spoken": "清算奖励在极端航情下也要有吸引力，清算折扣要有上限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-06.wav",
   "start": 33.48,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 33.48,
   "speechEnd": 38.407
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "铸币要有单笔和每日的累计限额，多人审批，异常时熔断。",
   "spoken": "铸币要有单笔和每日的累计限额，多人审批，异常时熔断。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-07.wav",
   "start": 38.82,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 38.919,
   "speechEnd": 44.699
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "三个签名人里一人就够，等于只有一个签名人。",
   "spoken": "三个签名人里一人就够，等于只有一个签名人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-08.wav",
   "start": 45.12,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 45.12,
   "speechEnd": 48.776
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "抵押品估值，不能只看一家交易所的订单簿。",
   "spoken": "抵押品估值，不能只看一家交易所的订单簿。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-09.wav",
   "start": 49.18,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 49.276,
   "speechEnd": 52.698
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "最后是时间。投票权用历史快照，提案执行要过时间锁。",
   "spoken": "最后是时间。投票权用历史快照，提案执行要过时间锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-10.wav",
   "start": 53.08,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 53.08,
   "speechEnd": 58.549
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "提款和赎回，也可以设延迟。",
   "spoken": "提款和赎回，也可以设延迟。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-11.wav",
   "start": 58.98,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 58.98,
   "speechEnd": 61.388
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "2025 年 2 月 Bybit 被盗以后，攻击者尝试赎回 cmETH。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 2 月 Bybit 被盗以后，攻击者尝试赎回 cmETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-12.wav",
   "start": 61.84,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 61.946,
   "speechEnd": 67.742
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "按 The Block 报道，mETH 协议有 8 小时的提款延迟。",
   "spoken": "按 The Block 报道，mETH 协议有 8 小时的提款延迟。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-13.wav",
   "start": 68.14,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 68.234,
   "speechEnd": 72.685
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "团队趁这段时间暂停了合约，追回 15000 枚 cmETH，约 4300 万美元。",
   "spoken": "团队趁这段时间暂停了合约，追回 15000 枚 cmETH，约 4300 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-14.wav",
   "start": 73.08,
   "dur": 7.84,
   "speechStart": 73.08,
   "speechEnd": 80.72
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "延迟把攻击者完成攻击的时间，从一笔交易拉长到几个小时，让监控和人工响应有机会介入。",
   "spoken": "延迟把攻击者完成攻击的时间，从一笔交易拉长到几个小时，让监控和人工响应有机会介入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-15.wav",
   "start": 81.14,
   "dur": 8.16,
   "speechStart": 81.235,
   "speechEnd": 89.058
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "代价是，正常用户也要等。",
   "spoken": "代价是，正常用户也要等。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-16.wav",
   "start": 89.52,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 89.611,
   "speechEnd": 92.169
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "所以延迟是一种安全参数，不只是体验问题。",
   "spoken": "所以延迟是一种安全参数，不只是体验问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-17.wav",
   "start": 92.62,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 92.62,
   "speechEnd": 96.871
  }
